    "allText": "===ARTICLE 0===\nAniya Intelligence\n@aniyaintel\nGPT image 2 on CHAT GPT\n\nPrompt:\n\nUse my uploaded female face as the ONLY identity reference for the main subject. Preserve my exact facial identity and natural appearance — facial structure, skin tone, eyes, eyebrows, nose, lips, cheekbones, jawline, facial proportions, hairline, hair texture, and natural skin texture. Keep me instantly recognizable. Do not beautify, reshape, feminize, masculinize, age, de-age, or alter my facial features.\n\nCreate a premium hyper-realistic futuristic music-tech editorial portrait of me wearing sleek glowing blue over-ear headphones with a luminous circular LED ring around the earcups. I am wearing a sophisticated deep cobalt-blue ribbed turtleneck sweater, creating a monochromatic futuristic aesthetic.\n\nPose me in a confident cinematic three-quarter side profile, chin slightly raised, looking upward and away from the camera with a calm, stylish expression. Add round reflective futuristic sunglasses with deep blue lenses, reflecting vertical neon city lights and modern skyscraper windows.\n\nUse dramatic electric-blue neon lighting throughout the scene. Strong blue rim light outlines my hair, headphones, shoulders, and sweater. Soft cinematic highlights illuminate my face while preserving realistic skin texture and natural facial details. Background is an intense deep-blue futuristic studio environment with subtle atmospheric glow and large bold abstract white typographic shapes behind me, resembling a premium technology/music advertising campaign without copying any existing advertisement or logo.\n\nMake the headphones look like a high-end fictional premium audio product, with realistic materials, glossy surfaces, metallic details, and a bright circular LED accent.\n\nPhotography style: ultra-realistic commercial fashion photography, futuristic editorial campaign, cinematic lighting, shallow depth of field, crisp facial details, realistic reflections, sophisticated composition, high contrast, premium luxury aesthetic, subtle film grain, photorealistic skin, volumetric blue glow.\n\nComposition: close-up to medium portrait, subject centered, face prominently visible, dramatic upward perspective, clean premium advertising composition.\n3:25 AM · Sep 15, 2026\n·\n1,124\nViews\n26\n2\n32\n9\n\n===ARTICLE 1===\nIman\n@WorkWith_Iman\nSep 15\nThat prompt creates a stunning, highly detailed futuristic portrait!\n1\n1\n18\n\n===ARTICLE 2===\nElsa Ai\n@ElsaSofia__AI\nSep 15\nThis futuristic look is stunning\n1\n1\n30\n\n===ARTICLE 3===\nMehwish kiran\n@mehwishkiran07\nSep 15\nThat futuristic cobalt-blue aesthetic is seriously stunning\n1\n1\n38",
