    "allText": "===ARTICLE 0===\nSoran\n@Soranlan\n刷 AI 信息最怕的就是关注一堆重复搬运工，这种按细分山头整理的高质量列表太稀缺了。\n\n中文圈 AI 资讯看着热闹，\n\n但真正有深度的一手思考基本都来自这拨人。\n\n与其被算法喂垃圾，不如直接蹲好这 15 个源头。\n\n> 如果你刚开始刷英文 AI 圈，别乱关注。\n\n先把这 15 个账号塞进列表里，不是那种泛泛而谈的 AI 博主，这批人基本各占一个细分山头。\n\n@karpathy\nLLM 这块不用多解释，很多人学大模型就是从他开始的。\n@steipete\n做 openclaw 的，工程味很重。\n\n@gregisenberg\nstartup ideas 这块，灵感密度很高。\n@rileybrown\nvibecode 代表人物之一，适合看 AI 编程怎么被普通人用起来。\n\n@jackfriks\nsolo apps 方向，很适合想一个人做产品的人盯。\n@levelsio\nstartup 老哥，执行力和商业嗅觉都很猛。\n\n@marclou\n也是 startup 方向，适合看小产品怎么从 0 起。\n@EXM7777\nAI ops + systems，偏系统化玩法，不只是炫工具。\n\n@eptwts\nAI money twitter，想看 AI 怎么和赚钱结合，可以关注。\n@godofprompt\nprompt 方向，属于名字就很直白的那种。\n\n@vasuman\nAI agents 方向，适合看 Agent 到底怎么做、怎么用。\n@AmirMushich\nAI ads，做广告素材和投放的人可以盯。\n\n@0xROAS\nAI UGC，偏商业内容生产。\n@egeberkina\nAI images，图像生成方向很强。\n\n@MengTo\nAI landing pages，适合看 AI 产品页面、设计和转化。\n这类列表最有用的地方，不是收藏。\n\n是你每天刷的时候，能慢慢看懂英文 AI 圈到底在关注什么。\n\n不然你很容易困在中文搬运里，别人都已经玩到下一层了。\nVivo\n@vivoplt\nMay 23\nbest 15 accounts to follow in AI:\n\n@karpathy = LLMs king\n@steipete = built openclaw\n@gregisenberg = startup ideas king\n@rileybrown = vibecode king\n@jackfriks = solo apps king\n@levelsio = startups king\n@marclou = startups king\n@EXM7777 = AI ops + systems king\n@eptwts = AI money twitter king\n@godofprompt = prompt king\n@vasuman = AI agents king\n@AmirMushich= AI ads king\n@0xROAS = AI UGCs king\n@egeberkina = AI images king\n@MengTo= AI landing pages king\n\nfollow them all and learn.\n4:21 PM · May 23, 2026\n·\n24.6K\nViews\n6\n8\n77\n100\n\n===ARTICLE 1===\nVivo\n@vivoplt\nMay 23\nbest 15 accounts to follow in AI:\n\n@karpathy = LLMs king\n@steipete = built openclaw\n@gregisenberg = startup ideas king\n@rileybrown = vibecode king\n@jackfriks = solo apps king\n@levelsio = startups king\n@marclou = startups king\n@EXM7777 = AI ops + systems king\n@eptwts = AI money twitter king\n@godofprompt = prompt king\n@vasuman = AI agents king\n@AmirMushich= AI ads king\n@0xROAS = AI UGCs king\n@egeberkina = AI images king\n@MengTo= AI landing pages king\n\nfollow them all and learn.\n\n===ARTICLE 2===\nJason傑森 🇭🇰 | 🛠️\n@cheuk_baby\nMay 27\n嘿这波筛选真挺用的\n1\n1\n100\n\n===ARTICLE 3===\n晚晚\n@An_yhl\nMay 24\n乱关注真的会把时间线刷成复读机\n1\n1\n72\n\n===ARTICLE 4===\nshaorax\n@shaoraxRAC\nJun 19\n不得不说我太想进步了\n1\n1\n66",
