    "allText": "===ARTICLE 0===\nAniya Intelligence\n@aniyaintel\nGPT image 2.5 on Chat GPT\n\nprompt:\n\nUse my uploaded female face as the ONLY identity reference for the main female model. Preserve my exact facial identity and natural appearance throughout the image — facial structure, skin tone, eyes, eyebrows, nose, lips, cheekbones, jawline, facial proportions, hairline, and natural skin texture. Keep me instantly recognizable. Do not beautify, reshape, feminize, masculinize, age, de-age, or alter my facial features.\n\nCreate a luxury high-fashion denim campaign poster inspired by the reference composition, but with a completely original, more premium art direction.\n\nShow me stepping confidently out from an enormous sculptural denim installation shaped like a flowing folded garment, creating an artistic illusion of scale. The oversized denim structure should occupy the left side while I emerge dynamically from its opening on the right, creating strong depth and visual storytelling.\n\nDress me in a premium contemporary denim couture outfit: a structured cropped indigo denim jacket with sculptural shoulders, elegant fitted denim corset top, high-waisted wide-leg denim trousers with sophisticated tailoring, subtle metallic detailing, and luxury fashion accessories. Add sleek pointed boots and minimal statement jewelry. Make the outfit editorial, sophisticated, feminine, and expensive-looking rather than casual.\n\nPose: confident fashion-editorial stance, one leg slightly forward, relaxed shoulders, natural elegant body language, holding a small sculptural denim handbag. Keep realistic anatomy and proportions.\n\nBackground: sophisticated cool ivory-gray studio environment with a seamless luxury backdrop and glossy reflective floor. Soft architectural shadows, subtle atmospheric depth, premium commercial lighting, realistic fabric texture, fine denim stitching, restrained highlights, and an elegant minimalist aesthetic.\n\nReplace the original typography with a high-end luxury fashion logo treatment. Large refined serif typography across the upper background reading:\n\n“DENIMÉ”\n\nUse elegant high-contrast editorial serif lettering with sophisticated spacing, thin hairlines, and a subtle embossed/metallic finish. Beneath it, add the tagline:\n\n“CRAFTED TO BE REMEMBERED.”\n\nUse smaller minimalist sans-serif typography for the tagline. Keep all text perfectly spelled, sharp, clean, balanced, and professionally typeset.\n\nComposition: premium fashion magazine advertising campaign, strong negative space, asymmetrical editorial layout, sophisticated visual hierarchy, cinematic perspective, realistic reflections, ultra-detailed denim fibers, natural skin texture, photorealistic face, luxury brand campaign aesthetic, Vogue-style editorial sophistication, studio photography, subtle film grain, high dynamic range.\n3:26 AM · Sep 17, 2026\n·\n264\nViews\n10\n14\n1\n\n===ARTICLE 1===\nJohnn\n@john_my07\n7h\nShe is looking stylish.\n1\n1\n7\n\n===ARTICLE 2===\nAynah\n@AynahhX\n7h\nLove the premium campaign feel here.\n1\n1\n9\n\n===ARTICLE 3===\nZephyra Leigh\n@ZephyraLeigh\n6h\nAwesome prompt\n12",
