    "allText": "===ARTICLE 0===\n九尾狐-FoxFairy🦊\n@Stellakjbk\nGTP-6-Astra做出的动漫角色转真人，分别是：中野四叶，小法，灰原哀，毛利兰\n动漫转真人的提示词在评论区👇\n九尾狐-FoxFairy🦊\n@Stellakjbk\nSep 9\nI gave Image 2.5 a try and generated a few images—both anime-style and photorealistic—and I’m really impressed!\n\nIt offers some significant improvements; here’s a quick summary:\n1. Enhanced realism for photorealistic images\nSkin, hair, clothing, and lighting look much more natural, with far less of that \"plastic\" look or typical \"AI feel.\"\n\n2. Better character consistency\nIt’s easier to preserve the original face and character identity when changing outfits, poses, or backgrounds.\n\n3. More precise localized editing\nWhen you ask it to modify just the skin tone, hair, clothing, or expression, it’s less likely to accidentally alter the face, composition, or background along with them.\n\n4. Greater stability across multiple edits\nThe character and overall image are less likely to drift or lose their original look after successive rounds of editing.\n\n5. Better execution of complex prompts\nIt handles combined requirements—such as character, pose, camera angle, lighting, clothing, background, and depth of field—with a higher level of overall quality.\n\n6. Reduced \"AI look\" in portraits\nDetails like natural smiles, skin texture, body contours, and photographic lighting make it much easier to achieve a genuine, \"real-photo\" feel.\n\nIn short:\nPeople look more like real people, the model follows instructions better, and the results are less prone to breaking during edits.\n\nFor those who frequently work with reference-based edits, portraits, or iterative fine-tuning, this upgrade is far more meaningful than just a simple boost in \"clarity.\"\n\nHere’s a look at an image I created of a female swordswoman in a Chinese animation style 👇. I’ll be sharing more Image 2.5 creations in various styles soon.\n\nThe prompt is in the comments section.👇\n\nGPT-Image 2.5 is now available on ZenMux. 👇\n8:21 AM · Sep 16, 2026\n·\n3,034\nViews\n4\n1\n34\n9\n\n===ARTICLE 1===\n九尾狐-FoxFairy🦊\n@Stellakjbk\nSep 9\nI gave Image 2.5 a try and generated a few images—both anime-style and photorealistic—and I’m really impressed!\n\nIt offers some significant improvements; here’s a quick summary:\n1. Enhanced realism for photorealistic images\nSkin, hair, clothing, and lighting look much more natural, with far less of that \"plastic\" look or typical \"AI feel.\"\n\n2. Better character consistency\nIt’s easier to preserve the original face and character identity when changing outfits, poses, or backgrounds.\n\n3. More precise localized editing\nWhen you ask it to modify just the skin tone, hair, clothing, or expression, it’s less likely to accidentally alter the face, composition, or background along with them.\n\n4. Greater stability across multiple edits\nThe character and overall image are less likely to drift or lose their original look after successive rounds of editing.\n\n5. Better execution of complex prompts\nIt handles combined requirements—such as character, pose, camera angle, lighting, clothing, background, and depth of field—with a higher level of overall quality.\n\n6. Reduced \"AI look\" in portraits\nDetails like natural smiles, skin texture, body contours, and photographic lighting make it much easier to achieve a genuine, \"real-photo\" feel.\n\nIn short:\nPeople look more like real people, the model follows instructions better, and the results are less prone to breaking during edits.\n\nFor those who frequently work with reference-based edits, portraits, or iterative fine-tuning, this upgrade is far more meaningful than just a simple boost in \"clarity.\"\n\nHere’s a look at an image I created of a female swordswoman in a Chinese animation style 👇. I’ll be sharing more Image 2.5 creations in various styles soon.\n\nThe prompt is in the comments section.👇\n\nGPT-Image 2.5 is now available on ZenMux. 👇\n\n===ARTICLE 2===\n九尾狐-FoxFairy🦊\n@Stellakjbk\nSep 16\n以提供的动漫原图为依据，生成一张人物容貌出众、自然鲜活、具有真实摄影质感的真人照片。保留原角色的身份特征、年龄感、气质、发型、服饰、神态与构图，将其转化为适合真人影视选角的漂亮面孔。单张完整画面，人物第一眼就有吸引力，细看仍然自然、可信，能够清楚认出对应的动漫角色。\n\n人物美感为重点。在保留角色辨识度的基础上，细致优化五官比例、面部轮廓与整体协调性，让人物拥有精致、上镜、有记忆点的长相。面部骨相舒展，额头、眉骨、鼻梁、面颊与下颌形成自然流畅的起伏；面颊饱满适度，下颌线清晰，下巴形态精巧自然。面部既有立体感，也有柔和的软组织过渡。根据原角色的特点呈现清秀、明艳、清冷或英气的美感，保留个人特色，避免把不同角色转换成同一张脸。\n\n眉眼是面部最有吸引力的部分。保留原角色的眉形、眼型与眼尾走势，将其调整为漂亮且合理的真人比例。眉毛自然舒展，眼睛清亮有神，眼睑线条流畅，睫毛纤细、疏密自然。眼神有明确的关注对象和细微情绪，瞳孔、虹膜与眼白比例真实，眼中带符合现场光源的柔和反光。鼻梁线条干净，鼻尖与鼻翼精巧协调；嘴唇柔润，厚薄适度，唇形清晰但边缘柔和。五官之间配合自然，正面与侧面都具有协调的美感，不夸张放大眼睛，不过度缩小鼻口。\n\n皮肤细腻、柔润、清透，具有健康的气色与真实的肌肤层次。肤色依据原角色还原，面部、耳朵、脖颈和身体自然统一；面颊带轻微血色，唇部色泽鲜活。正常观看距离下，皮肤显得干净细腻，近处清晰区域才隐约可见细小纹理。高光轻柔，明暗过渡平滑，保留皮肤的体积感。妆容精致、轻薄、贴肤，适度提亮气色和突出眉眼，不形成厚重粉感。不要额外添加粗大毛孔、斑点、深纹、眼袋或疲惫感，不通过粗糙化和增龄制造写实效果。\n\n表情延续原图，让人物显得有情绪、有注意力、有生命力。眉眼、面颊与嘴角共同表达同一种情绪，面部肌肉松紧自然，保留轻微的不对称。原图若有笑意，呈现从眼神自然流露、带动嘴角和面颊的动人笑容；原图若冷静或严肃，则保留沉静、专注的神态。头颈姿态舒展，肩膀自然，身体重心合理，手指与道具的接触准确，整体姿态好看而不僵硬。\n\n发型忠于原图的轮廓、长度、刘海、分缝、发色与主要走向，同时呈现真实头发的蓬松度、重量和发束层次。发际线自然，头发与面部衔接柔和，少量碎发顺着动作散落。服装与饰品保留原设计，材质具有真实的厚薄、垂感、纹理和反光；衣褶随身体姿态形成，领口、肩部和腰部的贴合关系合理，造型精致、合身。\n\n保持原图的画幅、人物数量、出镜范围、视角和主体位置。光线依据原场景自然建立，人物与背景的光源方向和色温一致。面部受光柔和而有层次，环境反射光适度照亮眼周与面颊，让眉眼清楚、肤色通透、轮廓立体。亮部不过曝，暗部不过重，避免生硬阴影造成不必要的憔悴感。整体色彩清澈、协调，保留原图的情绪与氛围。\n\n呈现真实相机拍摄的清晰度和空间感，焦点准确落在人物面部，细节随拍摄距离和景深自然变化。皮肤、发丝、衣物与背景拥有各自合理的质感，画面清晰细腻，边缘自然柔和。最终效果像一位容貌出众、气质贴合角色的真人，在真实环境中被拍下的精彩瞬间。\n\n避免：模板网红脸、过度整容感、夸张大眼、尖削下巴、僵硬假笑、空洞眼神、蜡像脸、塑料皮肤、厚重磨皮、粗糙噪点、额外增龄、假发感、游戏建模感、过度锐化、强烈HDR、不合理虚化、错误人体结构。\n4\n499\n\n===ARTICLE 3===\n小墨同学\n@xiaomovps\nSep 16\n为什么没有我的迪迦奥特曼？\n1\n1\n117",
