    "allText": "===ARTICLE 0===\nAmira Zairi\n@azed_ai\nNow we all know what the logo means 🤣\nAmira Zairi\n@azed_ai\nSep 16\n2:35 PM · Sep 16, 2026\n·\n2,625\nViews\n4\n29\n5\n\n===ARTICLE 1===\nAmira Zairi\n@azed_ai\nSep 16\n\n===ARTICLE 2===\nSairah\n@Sairah_0\n23h\nThis is epic\n1\n1\n22\n\n===ARTICLE 3===\nFuture Vibes AI - Educator\n@FutureVibesAi\nSep 16\nSam look much better 😂\n1\n1\n26\n\n===ARTICLE 4===\nEce\n@cecisko13\n4h\nU have a very sad life whoever u are lmao\n6",
