    "allText": "===ARTICLE 0===\nAbsurd (YC F25)\n@withabsurd\nThe Poison Taster\n24:56\n9:52 AM · Sep 17, 2026\n·\n30.9K\nViews\n96\n13\n141\n34\n\n===ARTICLE 1===\nFlare Horizon\n@flarehorizon275\n5h\nAI is changing filmmaking\nWhen the cost of turning imagination into reality approaches zero, human creativity becomes the new frontier.\nAnd this is only the beginning....\nI'm honored to be able to witness this great era of change with my own eyes.\n3\n96\n\n===ARTICLE 2===\nKathia\n@TheKathAI\n4h\nWOW It’s really impressive how far the AI can go\n3\n176\n\n===ARTICLE 3===\n澜森\n@lansenai\n2h\n非常棒的剧情和效果\n2\n98",
