    "allText": "===ARTICLE 0===\nAmira Zairi\n@azed_ai\n11:01 AM · Sep 17, 2026\n·\n900\nViews\n4\n25\n3\n\n===ARTICLE 1===\nAhmed\n@gridzzle\n3h\nThis is so poetic Amira 👽\n1\n1\n10\n\n===ARTICLE 2===\nNataly Che\n@creatoroff\n3h\nStunning artwork Amira 🫶\n1\n1\n11\n\n===ARTICLE 3===\nPromptSin\n@PromptSin\n3h\nThe light in these is unreal. \nThat train through the mist and the lanterns on the river feel like whole stories.\n1\n1\n14",
